This experiment history is important for developing the scanner.


---

# FINAL PRIORITY

The project is an experiment-driven computer-vision product.

Always optimize for answering:

> "Can we reliably see and detect PDR dent deformation using the reflection of the phone's own structured-light screen recorded by the phone's front-facing camera?"

Until the answer is clearly YES, avoid spending significant development time on anything unrelated to this core hypothesis.
